-- The saved variant a record names, and the label it goes by now: by its id,
-- so that a variant renamed since is still the one that was on.
-- Legacy payloads and unsaved in-memory requests can still have only labels.
-- Explicit v2 identities must never retarget a deleted variant to a different
-- persisted one that later reused its name.
function M.saved_of(record,domain)
