local ClothingWire = (function()
-- Wire contract v4, published on this client's own Steam lobby member key.
--
--   v4|<rev>|<lrev>|<body>|<armor>|<helmet>|<cape>
--   <slot> := - | <uuid32hex>:<digest8hex>:<toggles32hex>:<carrier8hex>
--
-- Position carries the slot; `-` is the explicit skip token and can never be
-- mistaken for a look, which is exactly 83 hex-and-colon characters. `rev`
-- changes on every publish; `lrev` only when the looks (or the body) change,
-- which is what tells an observer to rebuild the peer's actor from its own
-- composition (research/104). Every linked mod client publishes presence even
-- in stock gear: the key says "this client runs the transport" and nothing
-- else. Peer values are untrusted: bounded length, strict parse, and the whole
-- peer is rejected on any malformed field. No value here ever names a
-- resource, path or handle.
local Identity=ClothingIdentity or error('module is not bundled: src.clothing_identity')
