local ClothingRemote = (function()
-- The observer's hand on remote actors (research/104).
--
-- Measured on two machines 2026-09-30: writing a remote slot's requested
-- armor in this client's own customization manager rebuilds that actor on the
-- written record within seconds, no ownership involved, and restoring the
-- request rebuilds it back. So the observer applies the peers module's record
-- assignment itself: it points a peer's actor at the record composed for that
-- peer, re-streams it through an alternate record whenever that record's
-- composition changes (first sight included: the actor was built before this
-- client composed for it), re-applies after the peer's own replication reverts the
-- request, leaves alone a slot whose cache stops following, and never writes
-- the local slot (the headless refresh owns it) or a slot it cannot attribute.
--
-- A SteamID is mapped to a customization slot through the game's peer tokens
-- when the host provides them, else learned: one present peer and one live
-- remote slot bind directly; a peer whose published carriers exactly one free
-- slot wears (and no other unresolved peer claims) is that slot; otherwise the
-- first remote slot whose request changes shortly after a peer's look revision
-- advanced is that peer's slot.
--
-- One rebuild at a time per actor (measured 2026-09-30): while a slot's cache
-- has not followed its request, a new want waits, and the next write carries
-- whatever is wanted then, so a burst renders at the actor's own rebuild
-- cadence and never hands a look to the record the actor still renders. The
-- records an actor renders or streams toward are reported as occupied so the
-- peers module keeps them composed until the actor has moved on.
local Layout=GameCustomizationLayout or error('module is not bundled: src.game.customization_layout')
local Players,Map,Infos,Info=Layout.players,Layout.player_map,Layout.slot_infos,Layout.slot_info
local Equipment,Request,Cache=Layout.equipment,Layout.request,Layout.cache
local M={INTERVAL=500,STUCK=10000,LEARN_WINDOW=3000,FLIP_WAIT=2000}
local FIELDS={armor=Equipment.armor,helmet=Equipment.helmet,cape=Equipment.cape}
local ORDER={'armor','helmet','cape'}
