local LocalRestream = (function()
-- The wearer's own re-stream without a replicated flip (measured 2026-09-30).
--
-- Writing the LOCAL slot's cached armor to another record makes the game
-- rebuild the actor to the request within the second (the cape physics reset
-- is the tell) while the request, the field that replicates, never changes.
-- So a worn look change no longer needs the headless refresh's alternate
-- commit cycle, which every observer saw as a flip. The runner speaks the
-- clothing owner's redraw protocol: 'redraw' begins, 'status' reports
-- outcome=pending|complete|failed. It refuses while the slot is transitioning,
-- a native refresh is in flight or the Armory is open, and reports failed when
-- the cache does not follow in time; the owner then falls back.
