-- native work begins, and turns the result into health: `game.<capability>`
-- says whether that part of the game is where the mod expects it, and why not.
--
-- After a game update this is where to look first: `game-contract.txt` lists
-- every function and global, whether it was found, and where a function that
-- moved appears to have gone.
--
-- Provides: game {contract(), capability(name), address(name), alias(name,
-- address), declare(name, table), report(), packages(), resources(), materials()}.
